# Local Sanity seed commands

Canonical detail: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) § Sanity content — agent guardrails, and [`.claude/rules/dataset-script-placement-and-flags.md`](../../.claude/rules/dataset-script-placement-and-flags.md).

- **Never run** seed or dataset-write scripts yourself.
- When documenting or suggesting a command for **local** work, always include explicit flags:

```bash
pnpm <task> -- --dataset development --confirm
```

- Dry-run preview only: `--dataset development` (no `--confirm`).
- Production: `--dataset production --confirm --yes-production`.
- Never omit `--dataset` or rely on `NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_DATASET` / env defaults.
